### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Register alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "hunter2pass"
}

### 3. Login alice — capture token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "hunter2pass"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
    client.log("Token captured: " + response.body.token.substring(0, 30) + "...");
%}

### 4. List flash sales
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flash-sales

### 5. Reserve WITHOUT token (should be 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/flash-sales/12/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### 6. Reserve WITH token (should be 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/flash-sales/12/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}